OL,3,GNEWSASupermarket plan refused to
OL,4,Aprotect bats and newts
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a village's new supermarket
OL,7,Fhave been thrown out because of the
OL,8,Fharm it could cause to local bats and
OL,9,Fcrested newts.
OL,11,FLidl put forward proposals in August
OL,12,F2025 to construct a new store in
OL,13,FCheddar in Somerset, with more than 350
OL,14,Flocal residents submitting formal
OL,15,Frepresentations on the plans, which
OL,16,Fwere expected to create up to 40 local
OL,17,Fjobs.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
