OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1792491948
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSASupermarket plan refused to
OL,4,Aprotect bats and newts
OL,5,
OL,6,FSomerset Council refused planning
OL,7,Fpermission, arguing the company has not
OL,8,Fdone enough to show how local protected
OL,9,Fspecies would not be harmed by the
OL,10,Fdevelopment.
OL,12,FLidl has not yet indicated whether it
OL,13,Fintends to appeal, according to the
OL,14,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
